-- Tests for Dieu 94-108. V1 pinned at 1 June 2025, V2 at 1 March 2026, V3 at 1 August 2026. Dieu 94(4)-(5), 95 and
-- 99(3)-(4) take effect on 1 January 2028 in both texts of Dieu 156(2), so the day of the question matters.

§ `Tests: Dieu 94-108`

§§ `Dieu 94 and 95`

