`a deposit of two percent` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 300_000_000_000
    `amount deposited` IS 6_000_000_000
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS FALSE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS FALSE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the business has ceased` IS FALSE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS FALSE
`a deposit short of two percent` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 300_000_000_000
    `amount deposited` IS 5_999_999_999
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS FALSE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS FALSE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the business has ceased` IS FALSE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS FALSE
`a deposit used and replenished on day 90` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 0
    `amount deposited` IS 0
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS TRUE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS TRUE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2025 5 30
    `the business has ceased` IS FALSE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS FALSE
`a deposit used and replenished on day 91` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 0
    `amount deposited` IS 0
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS TRUE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS TRUE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2025 3 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2025 5 31
    `the business has ceased` IS FALSE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS FALSE
`a deposit used without approval` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 0
    `amount deposited` IS 0
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS TRUE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS FALSE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the business has ceased` IS FALSE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS FALSE
`a deposit used when solvency is not short` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 0
    `amount deposited` IS 0
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS FALSE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS TRUE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the business has ceased` IS FALSE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS FALSE
`the whole deposit withdrawn while trading` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 0
    `amount deposited` IS 0
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS FALSE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS FALSE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the business has ceased` IS FALSE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS TRUE
`the whole deposit withdrawn on cessation` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 0
    `amount deposited` IS 0
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS FALSE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS FALSE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the business has ceased` IS TRUE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS TRUE
`no withdrawal` MEANS `A deposit` WITH
    `minimum charter capital or minimum allocated capital at the time of establishment` IS 0
    `amount deposited` IS 0
    `the deposit is used to meet commitments to policyholders because solvency is short` IS FALSE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved the use in writing` IS FALSE
    `date the deposit was used` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `date the deposit used was replenished` IS YMD 2000 1 1
    `the business has ceased` IS FALSE
    `the whole deposit is being withdrawn` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(2): the deposit the insurer must make` `a deposit of two percent` EQUALS 6_000_000_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(2): the deposit made is the amount the Law requires` `a deposit of two percent`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(2): the deposit made is the amount the Law requires` `a deposit short of two percent`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(3): the use of the deposit is permitted` `a deposit used and replenished on day 90`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(3): the use of the deposit is permitted` `a deposit used without approval`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(3): the use of the deposit is permitted` `a deposit used when solvency is not short`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(3): the last day to replenish the deposit` `a deposit used and replenished on day 90` EQUALS YMD 2025 5 30
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(3): the deposit was replenished in time` `a deposit used and replenished on day 90`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(3): the deposit was replenished in time` `a deposit used and replenished on day 91`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 96(4): the withdrawal of the whole deposit is permitted` `the whole deposit withdrawn while trading`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(4): the withdrawal of the whole deposit is permitted` `the whole deposit withdrawn on cessation`
#ASSERT `Dieu 96(4): the withdrawal of the whole deposit is permitted` `no withdrawal`

