@ref Dieu 97-98 (src:2045-2080)
`a compliant reserve` MEANS `A technical reserve` WITH
    `set aside separately for each line of insurance` IS TRUE
    `corresponds to the liability committed under the contracts` IS TRUE
    `separate for contracts with objects inside and outside Vietnam, unless the law provides otherwise` IS TRUE
    `backed always by assets that correspond to it, with separate assets for the reserve for contracts abroad` IS TRUE
    `computed and set aside using the actuary` IS TRUE
    `reviewed and assessed regularly and made good in time` IS TRUE
    `the method of setting it aside was registered and approved by the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
`a reserve without the actuary` MEANS `A technical reserve` WITH
    `set aside separately for each line of insurance` IS TRUE
    `corresponds to the liability committed under the contracts` IS TRUE
    `separate for contracts with objects inside and outside Vietnam, unless the law provides otherwise` IS TRUE
    `backed always by assets that correspond to it, with separate assets for the reserve for contracts abroad` IS TRUE
    `computed and set aside using the actuary` IS FALSE
    `reviewed and assessed regularly and made good in time` IS TRUE
    `the method of setting it aside was registered and approved by the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
`a reserve with an unapproved method` MEANS `A technical reserve` WITH
    `set aside separately for each line of insurance` IS TRUE
    `corresponds to the liability committed under the contracts` IS TRUE
    `separate for contracts with objects inside and outside Vietnam, unless the law provides otherwise` IS TRUE
    `backed always by assets that correspond to it, with separate assets for the reserve for contracts abroad` IS TRUE
    `computed and set aside using the actuary` IS TRUE
    `reviewed and assessed regularly and made good in time` IS TRUE
    `the method of setting it aside was registered and approved by the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 97(2)-(3): the technical reserve meets the requirements` `a compliant reserve`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 97(2)-(3): the technical reserve meets the requirements` `a reserve without the actuary`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 97(2)-(3): the technical reserve meets the requirements` `a reserve with an unapproved method`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 97(4): the Government's rules on setting aside technical reserves and on registering the method`
