    `keeps the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` IS TRUE
    `complies with the insurance, investment and foreign exchange laws` IS TRUE
    `is made in the name of the insurer or reinsurer` IS TRUE
    `is managed and tracked separately` IS TRUE
    `covers a loss of the investment with money or assets of domestic policyholders` IS FALSE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved in writing before the investment` IS TRUE
    `the investor is a foreign branch in Vietnam` IS TRUE
`the same covering a loss with domestic policyholders' money` MEANS `An investment abroad` WITH
    `is establishing, funding or buying an insurer or reinsurer abroad, or a branch, representative office or other presence abroad` IS TRUE
    `is buying or selling securities or investing through funds or intermediaries abroad as the Government provides` IS FALSE
    `is funded from equity left after capital adequacy and solvency` IS TRUE
    `is funded from idle technical reserves of contracts linked to foreign investment indices or made with persons abroad` IS FALSE
    `keeps the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` IS TRUE
    `complies with the insurance, investment and foreign exchange laws` IS TRUE
    `is made in the name of the insurer or reinsurer` IS TRUE
    `is managed and tracked separately` IS TRUE
    `covers a loss of the investment with money or assets of domestic policyholders` IS TRUE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved in writing before the investment` IS TRUE
    `the investor is a foreign branch in Vietnam` IS FALSE
`an investment abroad from reserves of linked contracts` MEANS `An investment abroad` WITH
    `is establishing, funding or buying an insurer or reinsurer abroad, or a branch, representative office or other presence abroad` IS FALSE
    `is buying or selling securities or investing through funds or intermediaries abroad as the Government provides` IS TRUE
    `is funded from equity left after capital adequacy and solvency` IS FALSE
    `is funded from idle technical reserves of contracts linked to foreign investment indices or made with persons abroad` IS TRUE
    `keeps the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` IS TRUE
    `complies with the insurance, investment and foreign exchange laws` IS TRUE
    `is made in the name of the insurer or reinsurer` IS TRUE
    `is managed and tracked separately` IS TRUE
    `covers a loss of the investment with money or assets of domestic policyholders` IS FALSE
    `the Ministry of Finance approved in writing before the investment` IS TRUE
    `the investor is a foreign branch in Vietnam` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `Dieu 100: the investment abroad is permitted` `a permitted foreign investment`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 100: the investment abroad is permitted` `the same without prior approval`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 100: the investment abroad is permitted` `the same by a foreign branch`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 100: the investment abroad is permitted` `the same covering a loss with domestic policyholders' money`
#ASSERT `Dieu 100: the investment abroad is permitted` `an investment abroad from reserves of linked contracts`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 100(5): the Government's conditions, limits and procedure for investing abroad`

