`a life insurer registered under V1 only` MEANS `A separation of sources` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `registered the principle with the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks owners' equity, premium sources and their assets` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks revenue, cost and result of insurance business and investment` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks premium and reserves inside and outside the territory` IS TRUE
    `has a participating life contract portfolio` IS TRUE
    `separates the participating portfolio by a method the Ministry approved` IS TRUE
    `registered the principles and the method approved by the Ministry for separating sources and distributing surplus` IS FALSE
    `follows the registered or notified principles` IS FALSE
    `notified the principle of separation to the Ministry in writing before applying it` IS FALSE
`a life insurer under V2 only` MEANS `A separation of sources` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a life insurer`
    `registered the principle with the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `separates and tracks owners' equity, premium sources and their assets` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks revenue, cost and result of insurance business and investment` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks premium and reserves inside and outside the territory` IS TRUE
    `has a participating life contract portfolio` IS FALSE
    `separates the participating portfolio by a method the Ministry approved` IS FALSE
    `registered the principles and the method approved by the Ministry for separating sources and distributing surplus` IS TRUE
    `follows the registered or notified principles` IS TRUE
    `notified the principle of separation to the Ministry in writing before applying it` IS FALSE
`a non-life insurer that notified` MEANS `A separation of sources` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `registered the principle with the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `separates and tracks owners' equity, premium sources and their assets` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks revenue, cost and result of insurance business and investment` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks premium and reserves inside and outside the territory` IS TRUE
    `has a participating life contract portfolio` IS FALSE
    `separates the participating portfolio by a method the Ministry approved` IS FALSE
    `registered the principles and the method approved by the Ministry for separating sources and distributing surplus` IS FALSE
    `follows the registered or notified principles` IS TRUE
    `notified the principle of separation to the Ministry in writing before applying it` IS TRUE
`a non-life insurer that notified but does not follow` MEANS `A separation of sources` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `registered the principle with the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `separates and tracks owners' equity, premium sources and their assets` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks revenue, cost and result of insurance business and investment` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks premium and reserves inside and outside the territory` IS TRUE
    `has a participating life contract portfolio` IS FALSE
    `separates the participating portfolio by a method the Ministry approved` IS FALSE
    `registered the principles and the method approved by the Ministry for separating sources and distributing surplus` IS FALSE
    `follows the registered or notified principles` IS FALSE
    `notified the principle of separation to the Ministry in writing before applying it` IS TRUE
`a non-life insurer that registered under V1` MEANS `A separation of sources` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a non-life insurer`
    `registered the principle with the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks owners' equity, premium sources and their assets` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks revenue, cost and result of insurance business and investment` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks premium and reserves inside and outside the territory` IS TRUE
    `has a participating life contract portfolio` IS FALSE
    `separates the participating portfolio by a method the Ministry approved` IS FALSE
    `registered the principles and the method approved by the Ministry for separating sources and distributing surplus` IS FALSE
    `follows the registered or notified principles` IS FALSE
    `notified the principle of separation to the Ministry in writing before applying it` IS FALSE
`a reinsurer that only separates the records` MEANS `A separation of sources` WITH
    `kind of insurer` IS `a reinsurer`
    `registered the principle with the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
    `separates and tracks owners' equity, premium sources and their assets` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks revenue, cost and result of insurance business and investment` IS TRUE
    `separates and tracks premium and reserves inside and outside the territory` IS TRUE
    `has a participating life contract portfolio` IS FALSE
    `separates the participating portfolio by a method the Ministry approved` IS FALSE
    `registered the principles and the method approved by the Ministry for separating sources and distributing surplus` IS FALSE
    `follows the registered or notified principles` IS FALSE
