#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a life insurer registered under V1 only`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a life insurer registered under V1 only`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a life insurer under V2 only`)
