#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 8 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a life insurer under V2 only`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a non-life insurer that notified`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a non-life insurer that notified`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a non-life insurer that notified but does not follow`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a non-life insurer that registered under V1`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a non-life insurer that registered under V1`)
#ASSERT NOT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2025 6 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a reinsurer that only separates the records`)
#ASSERT `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a reinsurer that only separates the records`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `EVAL UNDER RULES EFFECTIVE AT` (YMD 2022 6 1) (`Dieu 101: the insurer meets the requirements on separating sources` `a reinsurer that only separates the records`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 101: the Government's and the Minister of Finance's rules on registering, notifying and separating`

