-- src:2266 | đã trích lập các quỹ, thực hiện đầy đủ các nghĩa vụ tài chính và bảo đảm tỷ lệ an
-- src:2267 | toàn vốn, khả năng thanh toán theo quy định của Luật này;
-- src:2268 | b) Chuyển số tài sản còn lại thuộc sở hữu của nhà đầu tư nước ngoài sau khi
-- src:2269 | kết thúc hoạt động tại Việt Nam.
-- src:2270 | 2. Việc chuyển tiền, tài sản khác ra nước ngoài được thực hiện theo quy định
-- src:2271 | của pháp luật Việt Nam.
@ref Dieu 105-107 (src:2214-2271)
`all audits and confirmations obtained` MEANS `The audits and reports of an insurer` WITH
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS TRUE
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS TRUE
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS TRUE
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS TRUE
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS FALSE
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` IS FALSE
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on insurance operations` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS FALSE
    `sent the solvency and risk management report` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` IS FALSE
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS FALSE
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
`audited accounts only` MEANS `The audits and reports of an insurer` WITH
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS TRUE
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS FALSE
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` IS FALSE
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on insurance operations` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS FALSE
    `sent the solvency and risk management report` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` IS FALSE
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS FALSE
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
`an auditor who found fraud and stayed silent` MEANS `The audits and reports of an insurer` WITH
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS FALSE
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS TRUE
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` IS FALSE
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on insurance operations` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS FALSE
    `sent the solvency and risk management report` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` IS FALSE
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS FALSE
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
`an auditor who found fraud and reported it` MEANS `The audits and reports of an insurer` WITH
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS FALSE
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS TRUE
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` IS TRUE
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on insurance operations` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS FALSE
    `sent the solvency and risk management report` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` IS FALSE
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS FALSE
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
`every periodic report sent` MEANS `The audits and reports of an insurer` WITH
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS FALSE
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS FALSE
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` IS FALSE
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS TRUE
    `sent the report on insurance operations` IS TRUE
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS TRUE
    `sent the solvency and risk management report` IS TRUE
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` IS TRUE
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS FALSE
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
`periodic reports missing one` MEANS `The audits and reports of an insurer` WITH
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS FALSE
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS FALSE
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` IS FALSE
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS TRUE
    `sent the report on insurance operations` IS TRUE
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS TRUE
    `sent the solvency and risk management report` IS TRUE
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` IS FALSE
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS FALSE
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
`an unreported development` MEANS `The audits and reports of an insurer` WITH
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS FALSE
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS FALSE
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` IS FALSE
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on insurance operations` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS FALSE
    `sent the solvency and risk management report` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` IS FALSE
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS TRUE
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` IS FALSE
`a reported development` MEANS `The audits and reports of an insurer` WITH
    `the annual financial statements were audited independently` IS FALSE
    `the solvency and risk management report was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the report on separating equity and premium sources was confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the reports on linked funds and pension funds were confirmed by an independent auditor` IS FALSE
    `the auditor found a material breach, fraud or unusual transaction` IS FALSE
    `the auditor notified the Ministry of Finance in writing` IS FALSE
    `sent the financial statements, and the cause and state if the audit opinion was not unqualified` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on insurance operations` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on separating equity and premium sources` IS FALSE
    `sent the solvency and risk management report` IS FALSE
    `sent the report on changes in capital for each risk` IS FALSE
    `an unusual development affected solvency or reputation, or a financial or other requirement was not met` IS TRUE
    `reported that development to the Ministry of Finance` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 105(1)-(2): the insurer has obtained the independent audit and confirmations` `all audits and confirmations obtained`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 105(1)-(2): the insurer has obtained the independent audit and confirmations` `audited accounts only`
#ASSERT `Dieu 105(3)(d): the auditor failed to notify the Ministry of Finance` `an auditor who found fraud and stayed silent`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 105(3)(d): the auditor failed to notify the Ministry of Finance` `an auditor who found fraud and reported it`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 105(4): the Minister of Finance's rules on confirmations`
#ASSERT `Dieu 106(1): the insurer has sent the Ministry of Finance the periodic reports` `every periodic report sent`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 106(1): the insurer has sent the Ministry of Finance the periodic reports` `periodic reports missing one`
#ASSERT `Dieu 106(2): the insurer failed to report an unusual development or a failure to meet requirements` `an unreported development`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 106(2): the insurer failed to report an unusual development or a failure to meet requirements` `a reported development`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Dieu 106(3): the Minister of Finance's rules on reports and information`
`profit left after funds and obligations` MEANS `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` WITH
    `is profit belonging to foreign investors left after setting aside funds, meeting financial obligations and keeping the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` IS TRUE
    `is assets belonging to foreign investors left after ending business in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `follows Vietnamese law on transferring money and assets` IS TRUE
`assets left at the end of business` MEANS `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` WITH
    `is profit belonging to foreign investors left after setting aside funds, meeting financial obligations and keeping the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` IS FALSE
    `is assets belonging to foreign investors left after ending business in Vietnam` IS TRUE
    `follows Vietnamese law on transferring money and assets` IS TRUE
`profit transferred outside the transfer rules` MEANS `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` WITH
    `is profit belonging to foreign investors left after setting aside funds, meeting financial obligations and keeping the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` IS TRUE
    `is assets belonging to foreign investors left after ending business in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `follows Vietnamese law on transferring money and assets` IS FALSE
`a transfer of something else` MEANS `A transfer of profit or assets abroad` WITH
    `is profit belonging to foreign investors left after setting aside funds, meeting financial obligations and keeping the capital adequacy ratio and solvency` IS FALSE
    `is assets belonging to foreign investors left after ending business in Vietnam` IS FALSE
    `follows Vietnamese law on transferring money and assets` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Dieu 107: the transfer abroad is permitted` `profit left after funds and obligations`
#ASSERT `Dieu 107: the transfer abroad is permitted` `assets left at the end of business`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 107: the transfer abroad is permitted` `profit transferred outside the transfer rules`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 107: the transfer abroad is permitted` `a transfer of something else`
